Truth: true_R_epilps, 253 days, Rt 0.619 to 7.802
Seeding: I0 = 500 on day 1 (NegBin draws from day 2)
Scoring days 14-253 (240 days), 100 replicates, shared across all SI settings

NegBin overdispersion estimated on the observed series: rho = 17.36
